async function currentToolMatches(expected,method){const s=await state(),row=toolRow(s);assert(exactPreferenceFields(viewFields(s),expected)&&exactPreferenceFields(row,expected)&&row.alpha===expected.alpha,'Tool preferences changed after '+method+': '+expected.kind);return {method,view:viewFields(s),saved:row,preferences_revision:s.preferences.revision};}
async function prepareRedo(stem){await loadAttributeFixture(triangleFixture);const before=await snapshot(stem+'-original');await selectBrush('Draw');await stroke(stem+'-draw',before.document.mesh,{ray:true});const edited=await snapshot(stem+'-edited');await chord('z');const restored=await snapshot(stem+'-with-redo');assert(restored.record.sha256===before.record.sha256,'Pending redo source preparation differs');return {before,edited,restored};}
